mask_refine.preview_note = Eky'okulabirako kikendeezeddwa okusobola okukola amangu. Obunene bw'emigo bupimibwa mu pikseli z'ekiwandiiko; Teekawo ekola ku bunene bwonna. Okugaziya kugaziya eky'okulabirako kino.
mask_refine.duplicate_note = Ekivaamu: omutendera omupya ogulina langi z'emigo ezitereezeddwa ne masiki. Omutendera ogwasooka gukuumibwa era gukwekebwa.
mask_refine.mask_note = Ekivaamu: masiki ku mutendera ogukolebwako. Pikseli z'omutendera n'ekitundu ekirondeddwa kati bikuumibwa.
mask_refine.no_raster = Londa omutendera gwa rasita okulongoosa masiki yaagwo.
mask_refine.locked = Sumulula omutendera guno nga tonnalongoosa masiki yaagwo.
mask_refine.no_mask = Sooka olonde ekitundu oba ogattako masiki y'omutendera.
mask_refine.changed = Ekiwandiiko kikyuse. Ggalawo Longosa Masiki oddemu okugiggulawo.
mask_refine.rgb_only = Okuggyawo emimwa gya langi kuliwo ku mitendera gya RGB. Okulongosa masiki kukolera mu nkola eno eya langi.
mask_refine.too_large = Masiki esukka ekkomo ly'ekifo eky'obukuumi mu jjukira. Kozesa ekiwandiiko oba ekitundu ekirondeddwa ekitono.
mask_refine.processing = Erongoosa masiki ku bunene bwayo bwonna… Oyinza okusazaamu nga tokyusizza kiwandiiko.
